                    0x0232,                             $ No support for: settable path, scaling, scaling links.
                                                        $ Real time update of value.  Value is gettable only.
									  $ Not Displayed 
                    0xC6,                               $ Data Type - unsigned short int
                    1,                                  $ Data Size
                    "Produced I/O Assembly",            $ Parameter Name
                    "",                                 $ Units String
                    "Choose the I/O assembly that you would like this module to produce.  The assemblies are defined in the module's installation instructions. Note!  You must change the scanner's consumed (Rx) data size for this module to match the assembly that you have chosen.  This can be done by selecting 'Edit I/O parameters' from the scanner's scanlist tab.",
